{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll play as the Harry and Larry brothers, two twin 9-year-old's who are on their quest to complete the annual Grocery Run event and win its grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUT YOUR REFLEXES TO THE TEST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fly through 24 colorful grocery aisle levels that get progressively faster and harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dodge hazardous obstacles scattered throughout including fish crates, ladders, snowballs, and more - this isn't your ordinary grocery store outing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect tasty treats such as fruit, candy, and, yes, even vegetables because Mom said we need more fiber in our diet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER NEW ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Get temporary invincibility and knock back those pesky fish crates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grab a shield for one-time protection against hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bounce off bumpers to reach extra treats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fly through speed-up and speed-down chambers to change your speed (and the music tempo).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use your mouse to move Harry and Larry up and down, while they automatically fly forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633040?t=1756979066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633040/6bf8903bbce6c0182f4fa1082b2a12106d00d792/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756979066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633040/8966fd5809d2b2c8b2d91c8ddbe09475b51611a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756979066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633040/8966fd5809d2b2c8b2d91c8ddbe09475b51611a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756979066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll play as the Harry and Larry brothers, two twin 9-year-old's who are on their quest to complete the annual Grocery Run event and win its grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUT YOUR REFLEXES TO THE TEST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fly through 24 colorful grocery aisle levels that get progressively faster and harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dodge hazardous obstacles scattered throughout including fish crates, ladders, snowballs, and more - this isn't your ordinary grocery store outing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect tasty treats such as fruit, candy, and, yes, even vegetables because Mom said we need more fiber in our diet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER NEW ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Get temporary invincibility and knock back those pesky fish crates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grab a shield for one-time protection against hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bounce off bumpers to reach extra treats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fly through speed-up and speed-down chambers to change your speed (and the music tempo).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use your mouse to move Harry and Larry up and down, while they automatically fly forward.</p>","developers":["Rasterzone Entertainment, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id"